WEBVTT

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.620
I am not about to be stranded
by something such as rain!

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.750
We are leaving, Sophia Ring!

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.250
What's your plan?

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:28.310
My dark barrier renders 
all attacks ineffective!

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.110
No. Don't think about him.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.360
Don't think about him. Don't think about him.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.390
This is emotional turmoil.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:09.540
The angel must be nearby.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:15.970
It's okay. I still have my power.
It hasn't disappeared.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.650
I have to do something before it does.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:21.560
It's you, Shichimiya.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.160
I thought Rikka had come home.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.150
She's been staying out late every night.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:33.040
I know it's summer vacation, but still.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:34.960
I see.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.880
Shichimiya, your sticker is coming off.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:37.400
What?

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.300
Darn you, angel! It will take more
than these cheap illusions...

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.130
...to faze this magical girl!

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:47.630
What the...?

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:28.110
You haven't been getting enough sleep.

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:30.400
Where were you out so late yesterday?

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:32.970
EPISODE X GAUNTLET OF RAIN [OR]
A MIDSUMMER NIGHT'S... RAIN AND WHIPS

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.490
As I have told you many times,
to speak it means death.

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:37.770
Knock that off or you're grounded.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.960
Due to the proximity of the Priestess...

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.290
...you may have been mentally contaminated.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.540
You are even starting to look like her.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.470
Shut up!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.460
Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.000
Ha!

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.090
Miss, no diving please!

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:55.040
Is that Togashi?

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:55.720
Who are you?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:56.970
It's me, me!

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.170
Oh, Takanashi.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.420
Who are you?!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.810
Can you defeat me within the water,
Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.940
Take that!

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.570
P-please, not there!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:09.980
Stop making weird sounds!

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.940
Cento, we're not allowed to jump
into pools in Japan!

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:12.810
Agreed!

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:18.150
And Toka is the same as always.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.610
Yuta, look.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.250
Forget. You must forget.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.790
Make it all disappear, in the Devil's name!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:27.630
Shichimiya?

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:30.550
In the profane name of the Angel Lucifer,
rid me of my memory!

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.290
Shichimiya.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:33.840
It's still not working!
I can hear his voice!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:34.850
One more time!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:35.840
Shichimiya?

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.510
Hero!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.970
I didn't know you were here.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.770
That is an excellent meditation spot.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:42.920
Huh? Oh.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:48.270
That's right! As a magical devil girl,
I meditate daily!

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.050
Shichimiya, your shoulder!

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:52.520
Get with it!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.570
The attacks are getting 
more vicious every day!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.450
That was freaky.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.410
What got into you?!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:05.860
I don't know, but I am a 
veritable feast of rage.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.900
What are you blithering about?!

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.460
Okay, Rikka and I will be at the library
doing our homework.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.390
Right.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.340
Yuta, increased body temperature confirmed.

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:20.050
I hereby request supplementary
cooling components.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:20.630
Ice cream?

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.460
If possible, soft.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.050
Hey.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:25.560
Yes?

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.230
Where's Scarf gone?

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.770
You mean Shichimiya?

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:30.920
I think she went home already.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:31.640
What about her?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.060
No, never mind then.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.270
So, only Rikka can see it.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.200
What is this?

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.740
There's nobody here!

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.920
It doesn't happen till nightfall.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:55.180
Would you like to take turns napping?
I brought pillows.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:56.420
I'm leaving.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:59.050
You can't. The neighborhood
association director said...

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:03.060
...that if we stay here until night time,
they'll pay us for our time.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.810
Then they should put us to work!

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:09.600
I can't stand wasting time like this
without any sense of accomplishment!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.180
It sucks to be you, Morisummer.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.070
Don't call me that!

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:17.430
It could definitely use more momentum.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.400
Now see here.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:19.570
Schwing!

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:23.950
Must you always insist upon
interfering with my plans?!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.900
I didn't ask you to follow me here!

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.960
I am compelled to send you beyond
the reaches of the parallel world.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.460
I was feeling bored anyway.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.830
It couldn't hurt to play 
along once in a while.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.800
I am buying all of these water yo-yo's!

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:41.080
Thank you, come again!

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:46.130
I take this to mean you 
will do battle with me?

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.600
Do battle nothing.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.090
I am going to crush you without mercy!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.190
Nice try!

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:55.680
Nice try!

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.030
Ugh!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.350
Ow!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.660
This is your fault!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.120
You're to blame for this!

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.830
What did you want to talk about?

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.900
Yes, I have a favor to ask.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.290
I, Dekomori, am my master's servant!

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.500
I will happily obey her sister!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.130
Why are you sucking up to her?!

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:18.380
I wanted to do something
about it myself if I had the time...

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.700
...but I have to head back to Italy soon.

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.710
What?

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.210
MUNICIPAL LIBRARY

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.890
You have no intention of doing your homework.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.480
But we did just get out of the pool.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.360
INCOMING TEXT - TOKA

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:53.360
Toka?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.580
SUB: GOING BACK TO ITALY
Find the answer for yourselves.
Contact me if there's trouble.
That is all.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:05.630
Yes, that's right. I'm on 
my way back to Italy now.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:08.380
Don't worry. I've checked in on Rikka.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.310
I see. Thanks.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.730
The next time you come back...

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.660
...we should sit down for a meal together,
just the three of us.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:16.890
Yeah.

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:30.040
Disappear! My netherworld 
barrier is active...

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.740
...so none of your attacks 
will affect me, Angel!

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:40.340
I think this is an extremely formidable foe.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.250
YOU'VE GOT MAIL
WICKED LORD SHINGAN
UNSEAL

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:50.170
I am completely restored! 
HP/MP are topped up!

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.930
You're pumped up with magical energy!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.980
The barrier on this room is impeccable.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.150
As I would expect from a magical devil girl.

00:08:57.150 --> 00:09:00.180
Tonight I will once again attempt
to locate the parallel world.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.180
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:05.440
Regarding the whereabouts of
the key to the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:09.320
You're still looking for the last one then?

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:13.540
Naturally, for I am bound by contract
to the Dark Flame Master.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:17.880
It is Wicked Lord Shingan's mission.
Only I can locate it.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:19.330
But...

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.450
You just can't find it?

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:26.510
Magical Girl TWIRLY CURLY KURI

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:25.130
Someone is interfering. Perhaps
it is the Mage Association's doing...

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:28.330
...out of fear the evolution 
of Dark Flame Master.

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:32.260
The night of the blue moon
could be upon us at any time.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:35.020
This is tricky. Why don't you ask Hero?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.470
Maybe he remembers something.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.100
That I cannot do.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.430
That will not hold
as proof of our contract.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.730
Really?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:42.490
Yes.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.150
Yuta, that hurts.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:59.270
I said you'd be punished the next time 
you left without saying anything!

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:00.440
Where were you?

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.290
That I cannot say.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:06.160
Yuta, this is a time of 
repose for Dark Beings.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.720
The attack of the Light Beings
is taking its toll on my barrier...

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.680
...and I am so sleepy.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.250
No sleeping!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:17.880
Honestly. You and your sordid hobbies.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:21.810
What other choice do I have?
And I never asked you to tag along.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.760
There's Shichimiya now!

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:26.110
She looks out of it.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.820
She sighed!

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.520
She looked at Togashi's apartment!

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:34.530
It looks like Toka was right.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.940
She's in love...

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.700
...with Togashi?

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.460
Exactly!

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.500
Tell us if it isn't so.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.160
Well?

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:49.440
What are you talking about?
I am a magical devil girl!

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:52.720
I am charged with my
eternal battle against the angel.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.970
I am not like your average human being.

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.190
She averted her eyes!

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.560
I want you imagine the following:

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:03.970
What?

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:06.380
You are alone in a classroom with Togashi.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.180
You are alone in a movie 
theatre with Togashi.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.570
You are alone on a desert 
island with Togashi.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.660
Activating Devil Barrier!

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:19.160
This renders any psychological 
attack ineffective!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:22.170
She even reacts identically to Takanashi.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.910
Because she's in love.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.710
So you're in love with Togashi, huh?

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:31.370
Are you in fact a marauder
who showed up on this land...

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.380
to wrest Ghelzonianses away from my master?!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.850
Are you a homewrecker?

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:39.570
N-no! I'm not! Please believe me!

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.680
But you've always had
a thing for him, haven't you?

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.730
I admit, there once was a period of time...

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.690
...when I experienced emotional
instability towards Hero.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:54.250
But that was then that I made

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:58.290
my decision to live my life as a 
magical devil girl for eternity!

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:00.820
I'm saying that everything is resolved.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:04.080
In accordance to the logic of the world
and its natural laws.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.330
What's that?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.790
That makes sense!

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.700
Deko seems to get it.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:13.000
Don't worry. I have defeated
the enemy within once before.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.080
I will stamp it out thoroughly this time.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.540
Yuta, over here.

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.630
There is a shortcut through this park.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.390
It's Master!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:21.670
Hide, you idiot!

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:25.940
Is that the festival of the living dead?!

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.180
Don't talk about it like that!
It's the Bon Festival dance!

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.970
The ceremonial dance performed
by a myriad of people...

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.350
to summon the dark follower
converts to this world.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.310
I said, don't talk about it like that!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:37.910
Now come on. Let's go!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:40.160
Yuta, wait!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.830
I'm glad they didn't see us.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.790
That's because I put up a barrier.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:50.590
I am tops when it comes to barriers!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.520
Shichimiya.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.460
What are you gonna do?

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.250
Nothing changes for me.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:02.970
I am and always will be the devilish girl
who rules the magical seven holy lands.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:04.500
That's all.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.470
I doubt it.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.320
I doubt it's that easy.

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:19.200
I am at war with myself...

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.280
so naturally I've factored in
the personal damage!

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:55.030
Kuzuha, are you done yet?

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.440
Yes, almost.

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:59.060
That ought to do it. There, done!

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.580
You look so cute, Rikka!

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.830
What do you think? Not too tight?

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.540
It is difficult to access my weapon.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.350
Weapon?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.490
The Schwartz Z/X Perfect
Customized Ghelzonianses!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.850
You can't take that with you.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:17.470
No. I must keep this on 
my person at all times.

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.750
To Wicked Lord Shingan, it is essential.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:23.500
Oh, I see. That's because
my big brother gave it to you!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.630
You two are so lovey dovey.

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:29.220
Ow, ow! That hurts, Rikka!

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.350
What should I do?

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:33.520
Huh?

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.480
My power is now gone and 
I've lost everything.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:38.730
What am I?

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:44.980
Wha-?

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:47.240
What?!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.530
I split my magic with you.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.740
You got a job, Kuzuha?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.690
Yeah. The neighborhood association director
urged me to come...

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:58.880
saying they'd pay me for my time.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:14:59.710
You'll be busy.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.390
Where is Satone?

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.590
I think Rikka invited her to come...

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:05.320
...but she was too busy to make it.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:06.890
Yuta!

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:08.230
What is it?

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.520
The deathly ghost planet!

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.560
You mean Venus?

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:12.400
It's red! Fire attributes?

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.760
Then it can't be Venus.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.360
Why am I hiding?

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.360
Get a grip! Fight, Sophia!

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.270
I am a magical devil girl!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.280
COTTON CANDY

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.780
Step right up!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:38.790
WATER BALLOONS (1 TRY 100 YEN)

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.390
Yo-Yo fishing is so much fun!

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:33.650
Morisummer is such a hard worker.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:35.460
She is just plain noisy.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.460
Good work.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.500
You're at it.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:41.940
Master! Your dark plumage
does justice to your dark being!

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.080
Where's Kuzuha?

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:46.250
She's been captured by
the neighborhood association.

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:47.760
She has it hard.

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:51.760
Then why did she bother coming
to the festival in a yukata?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:55.640
I think she finds it fun in her own way.

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:53.050
What is that?

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.650
I think she finds it fun in her own way.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.280
I am magical devil girl,
Sophia Ring SP Saturn VII!

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:05.700
I am the magical devil girl Sophia
the whole town is talking about.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:09.740
AKA the devilish girl who rules
the magical seven holy lands.

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.520
And don't you forget it!

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:13.540
Shichimiya.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.130
So you did come after all.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.870
Well, my schedule opened up.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:20.710
Hey, where's Rikka?

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:24.130
She sensed a dark presence
a moment ago and went that way.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.000
What? For crying out loud.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:29.260
I told her to stay put so she
wouldn't mess up her yukata.

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:32.600
What's the big idea?

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:35.230
I came to make war with the enemy within.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.810
Make war, you say?

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.770
Yeah. The enemy is inside me,
so I can't escape it.

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:42.900
That's why I've decided to fight it.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.270
But how?

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:47.900
I have a plan!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:50.850
Stand by for my report of victory!

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:52.240
Will she be okay?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.740
Rain?

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:04.040
Surely it can't have gotten this far.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.770
Yeesh. Where the heck is she?

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:13.300
Hero!

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.350
Shichimiya. Have you seen Rikka?

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:20.960
No, but I suspect she has
spotted a dark follower.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.560
Yikes, it's really coming down now.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.130
Are you dry enough over there?

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:38.770
I'm fine. I have put up a barrier.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.120
A barrier, huh?

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.840
Be careful to give the deities
behind you their space.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:49.210
Well now, let's start the hostilities.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:50.260
Huh?

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:51.570
Say, Hero?

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:53.270
You have entered into a

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.580
lover's contract with Wicked 
Lord Shingan, haven't you?

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.340
S-sure, sorta.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:02.600
Have you done it? I mean...

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.140
...have you kissed and stuff?

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.610
Why are you asking that?!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:07.570
Answer me.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:08.730
Why should I?!

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:10.480
Because this is a battle.

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.610
You won't get angry no matter what?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.480
Why would I get angry?

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:21.810
For some reason, Nibutani gets angry
when I'm honest with her.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.700
That's because Morisummer 
is mentally unstable.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.370
I practice self-discipline, so I'll be fine.

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:28.770
You're sure?

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:31.880
Yeah.

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.110
Not yet.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.690
I see.

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:42.440
But I should mention that we've held hands.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.450
We've even touched noses thanks to you.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:48.990
What's wrong?

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:52.500
Never mind me. This is my battle.
Please continue.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.800
What battle?

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.150
Just tell me.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.650
Do you love Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.460
Would you just drop it already?

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:01.480
Just tell me!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.170
Yes, I love her.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.680
What do you love about her?

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:13.990
There's more to it than that.

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:17.270
I guess I love everything about her.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.260
Hey, you'll get wet.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:25.270
That attack was harsh. 
Its power is impressive.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.030
That one registered as critical.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.860
What are you talking about?

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:33.520
Pay me no mind. I'm fighting a good fight.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:35.590
For me it's just embarrassing!

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.540
There's no way around 
it, because this is war.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.540
This is a matter of life or death.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:43.570
Please continue.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.290
You still wanna do this?

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:49.790
Yes. I should be able to 
move in for the kill soon.

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:52.580
Honestly.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:59.090
You know, Rikka was
watching me the entire time.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:02.190
She watched me and kept on believing...

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:05.360
even after I had stopped
believing in my own power.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:11.200
I have mostly given up on it,
but she keeps encouraging me.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.080
She said I was incredible.
She said I had unique power.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:18.570
I see.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.200
Are you satisfied?

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:23.840
Why are both you and Nibutani
so keen to hear stuff like that?

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.270
INCOMING TEXT - RIKKA TAKANASHI

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:28.230
Rikka?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:29.790
The water mage's attack has intensified.
Rescue requested.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:33.250
Trust her not to have her umbrella
when she needs it.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.470
Go to her.

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:36.300
But...

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:40.180
I told you. I'm fine 
because I have my barrier!

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.230
You're hopeless.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:45.720
Huh?

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.100
You don't accept goodbyes, right?

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:56.610
Uh, yeah.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:21.770
I successfully held back the tears!
I am victorious!

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:24.060
It was a formidable foe,

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.490
but it will take more than that 
to shake up the rock-steady

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:27.740
Sophia the magical devil girl!

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:28.310
Here.

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:36.400
I found something you can use
abandoned over there.

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:40.580
That's not fair.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.150
Huh?

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:45.150
Only a coward resorts to surprise attacks.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:46.760
Shichimiya?

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.820
You can't do things like this.

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:53.290
You just can't!

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:05.970
TO BE CONTINUED
